# REST

## 1. Admin Section
### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9093/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": true
}

### 1.2 Signup
### 1.3 Forgot Password
### 1.4 Profile


## 2. User Section
### 2.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.2 Signup
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/local/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

### 2.3 Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9093/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

### 2.4 Profile
GET http://localhost:9093/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>